    "content": "<p>The Day of the Dead is upon us, and War Robots: Frontiers is joining in with the festivities. Pilots can now participate in the <strong>Festival of Souls Event</strong>, active now until <strong>November 3 (23:59 CET).&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>All Pilots playing via <a href=\"https://static.gc.my.games/WarRobotsFrontiersLoader.exe\">MY.GAMES Launcher</a> and <a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1491000/War_Robots_Frontiers/\">Steam</a> can participate in this event, where <strong>winning three Battles</strong> will net you a terrific treat: the <strong>Sepulchre Sticker.&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2024/11/145-FestivalofSouls/1.png\" /></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>This reward is permanent and will not be subject to future progress wipes.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Subscribe to the <a href=\"https://wrfrontiers.com/subscribe\">official newsletter</a> to get more of the latest news like this straight to your inbox, follow the game on <a href=\"https://twitter.com/WRFrontiers\">X </a>(Twitter), <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/wrfrontiers\">Facebook</a>, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@WRFrontiers/community\">YouTube</a>, <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/wrfrontiers/\">Instagram</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/warrobotsfrontiers/\">Reddit</a>, and join the <a href=\"https://wr.app/FrontiersDiscord\">official Discord server</a>. You can also wishlist and follow War Robots: Frontiers on <a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1491000\">Steam</a> to get the latest news there.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&iexcl;Feliz D&iacute;a de los Muertos!</p>",
